{"4787210": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sunny Island", "steam_appid": 4787210, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Restore Your Grandfather’s Tropical Resort</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/265963a579500e3fa6850ee658e392f9.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/265963a579500e3fa6850ee658e392f9.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/265963a579500e3fa6850ee658e392f9.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny Island is a cozy first-person life sim where you arrive on a sunny island and take over an old resort left behind by your grandfather. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The place is damaged, abandoned, and far from its former glory. Step by step, you can bring it back to life: repair buildings, decorate spaces, open new services, and turn a forgotten family business into a lively tropical resort. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Build, Decorate, and Grow Your Resort</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/70f130c3c4c0ba726a52b25bda735773.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/70f130c3c4c0ba726a52b25bda735773.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/70f130c3c4c0ba726a52b25bda735773.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every building, decoration, and upgrade helps transform the island. You start with simple repairs, then unlock new facilities, areas, and ways to expand. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a shop, prepare a bar, start a restaurant, renovate rental cabins, and create a place where tourists want to spend their time. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Run Your Own Island Businesses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/1bac1a34aff431e4eb59d89a73664a5a.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/1bac1a34aff431e4eb59d89a73664a5a.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/1bac1a34aff431e4eb59d89a73664a5a.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tourists arrive on the island by boat, and you decide how to take care of them. Sell products, prepare orders, manage cabins, and keep your resort running better each day. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day can look different. Work on your businesses, gather resources, decorate a new area, or head out and see what lies beyond the resort. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Farm, Fish, Gather, and Dive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/afbeab08533d9b64b8db4b03793f184f.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/afbeab08533d9b64b8db4b03793f184f.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/afbeab08533d9b64b8db4b03793f184f.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island gives you everything you need to grow. Plant crops, catch fish, collect ingredients, and search for materials in the wilder parts of the island. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also dive beneath the surface, where more resources, hidden places, and rare finds wait underwater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Discover Secrets with Your Feathered Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/3f2f4f980408ecde452f9bf3b0ac6113.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/3f2f4f980408ecde452f9bf3b0ac6113.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/3f2f4f980408ecde452f9bf3b0ac6113.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your journey, you will find a cute, slightly clumsy feathered creature. It becomes your companion and helps you reach places you could not access alone. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you will solve light puzzles, open new paths, and find hidden parts of the island.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Explore an Island Full of Secrets</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/d8f3e8302f930e0e120c9ac2d1b2b465.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/d8f3e8302f930e0e120c9ac2d1b2b465.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/d8f3e8302f930e0e120c9ac2d1b2b465.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sunny Island is more than a resort. Walk through beaches, caves, ruins, hidden paths, and underwater locations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve simple environmental puzzles, discover secret places, and collect rare resources that help you develop the resort even further. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Play Alone or with a Friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/139fedeb6cf0dc4656d5aa52b4053137.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/139fedeb6cf0dc4656d5aa52b4053137.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/139fedeb6cf0dc4656d5aa52b4053137.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the resort peacefully at your own pace, or invite a friend and play together in 2-player co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split the tasks or do everything side by side. One player can serve guests while the other gathers resources. You can decorate the resort, fish, dive, or discover hidden locations together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><br>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong><br><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or 2-player co-op</strong>: restore the resort on your own or together with a friend.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy first-person life sim</strong>: live, work, explore, and relax on a sunny tropical island.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resort restoration</strong>: repair buildings, decorate interiors, expand facilities, and bring your family business back to life.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island businesses</strong>: run a shop, bar, restaurant, and rental cabins.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tourists arriving by boat</strong>: serve visitors, take care of their needs, and build a place they will want to return to.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming, fishing, gathering, and diving</strong>: collect resources on land and underwater.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island community</strong>: meet residents, build relationships, and take part in seasonal events.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feathered companion</strong>: discover a cute, clumsy creature that helps you solve puzzles and unlock new places.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets to discover</strong>: explore beaches, caves, ruins, hidden paths, and underwater locations.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons, weather, and day-night cycle</strong>: plan each day around time, stamina, events, and changing conditions.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://