as/139fedeb6cf0dc4656d5aa52b4053137.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore the resort peacefully at your own pace, or invite a friend and play together in 2-player co-op</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split the tasks or do everything side by side. One player can serve guests while the other gathers resources. You can decorate the resort, fish, dive, or discover hidden locations together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><br>━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━</strong><br><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or 2-player co-op</strong>: restore the resort on your own or together with a friend.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy first-person life sim</strong>: live, work, explore, and relax on a sunny tropical island.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resort restoration</strong>: repair buildings, decorate interiors, expand facilities, and bring your family business back to life.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island businesses</strong>: run a shop, bar, restaurant, and rental cabins.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tourists arriving by boat</strong>: serve visitors, take care of their needs, and build a place they will want to return to.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Farming, fishing, gathering, and diving</strong>: collect resources on land and underwater.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Island community</strong>: meet residents, build relationships, and take part in seasonal events.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feathered companion</strong>: discover a cute, clumsy creature that helps you solve puzzles and unlock new places.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets to discover</strong>: explore beaches, caves, ruins, hidden paths, and underwater locations.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seasons, weather, and day-night cycle</strong>: plan each day around time, stamina, events, and changing conditions.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/1d4ed406653dd94adf26c1c846af9e29.poster.avif?t=1784294618\" width=780 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/1d4ed406653dd94adf26c1c846af9e29.webm?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/extras/1d4ed406653dd94adf26c1c846af9e29.mp4?t=1784294618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Restore your grandfather’s abandoned island resort in a cozy first-person life sim you can play solo or in 2-player co-op. Build, farm, fish, run your businesses, meet the locals, and explore a sunny island full of secrets with the help of a cute, clumsy feathered companion.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Greek, Spanish - Latin America, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/04578f692c43c7a7e7e4603ef1817f2770025013/header.jpg?t=1784294618", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/8ecbd9ffe760382ebefafa1c03d8ce15256627c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784294618", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4787210/8ecbd9ffe760382ebefafa1c03d8ce15256627c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784294618", "website": "https://www.l